OL,3,GNEWSANI Secretary defends planned
OL,4,Achanges to Troubles bill
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Northern Ireland Secretary Sir
OL,7,FChris Bryant has defended the
OL,8,Fgovernment's planned changes to the
OL,9,FNorthern Ireland Troubles Bill.
OL,11,FIt had proposed 156 amendments to the
OL,12,Fbill which will be debated and voted on
OL,13,Fnext to week.
OL,15,FThe bill seeks to deal with the
OL,16,Funresolved legacy of the decades-long
OL,17,Fviolent conflict.
OL,19,FSinn Fein has dismissed the proposed
OL,20,Fchanges as a "veterans charter" which
OL,21,Fit says aims to keep soldiers out of
OL,22,Fcourt.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
